  },
  "relocations": "Franchises keyed by MODERN tricode. Historical identities (Oilers, St. Louis Cardinals/Rams, San Diego Chargers, Baltimore Colts, Oakland/LA Raiders...) are era entries under the modern key with identity + tricode."
